Hi Friends!

Today our game is leaving Steam Early Access. I would like to thank you for your support and feedback. All this helped bring our game to release!

And now, the list of changes in version 1.0:

 Achievements!
 Two new languages - German and Simplified Chinese;
 Fifth dungeon area;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/39da286d537e149df42e318fdbd07ea296fffa3c.png
 Final part of the game;
 New class - Ranger;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/e7af30d2c8abdbda0116362159dc0ec2701f9f49.png
 New type of weapon - Bows;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/e476fea92a0ecf371a241dcafe331805f90639e0.png
 New items and interactive objects;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/21f8772fbe62b4420e0064723fce1375ebc74381.png
 New Dark Idols;
 New special rooms;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/9f5a5568d5d704db84bd4de4b98fb44e53d4404f.png
 Bug fixes and game balance improvements.

Hi!
First of all, I am happy to announce that we are now actively working on the final version of the game and plan to release it this summer. But before that, we decided to release this small update. Main changes:

 Many new locations in the Parallel World and reworked old ones;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/83901d235b4fe64f011b5025c6511c5c7b950bed.jpg
 Dungeon levels now have bugs crawling around. Crush them to increase your Rage or get gold;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/2335decf26590a9d0f44bbd1b89d2e4d2358ba81.jpg
 New chest - with crystals of Exp;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/13bc6e0f8d0dbdadc7ac57f7777d86cb540c67f1.jpg
 Some game screens have been redesigned;
 Added several new items and changed some existing ones;
 Now you can delete saves and turn off the camera animation when hitting;
 Lots of small improvements and fixes.

Changelog:

 A system for gaining experience and leveling up a character has been added;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/53fc950c644c92f896d70a5f70cc8ed4bf9f6fbd.jpg
 The hub has been completely redesigned;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/489f632a7e8211c83bd384d2f8d2781cbf1a6bfb.jpg
 New class - Warlock;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/0ce76d1358cf2b9725b3eeef098ef3880a0cbabc.jpg
 Added a fourth boss;
 The inventory screen has been redesigned;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/f77a60d99e95cedf68bdb180e83086cbf5dc3a77.jpg
 New special rooms and interactive objects;
 Now you can purchase insurance before the boss battle.
 Several new items;
 Lots of small changes and fixes.

Changelog:

Fourth dungeon area;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/f52e2b302cd580d45448bb56102efcab04ead331.png
Shields;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/a08b9ac83789bec89526dbfd9514dac1c5879aa8.png
New class - Paladin;
Gamepad support (with aim assist);
Few slots for saves;
You can now ignite and push Explosive Barrels;
New options. For example - you can turn on a minimap;
Volumetric Fog;
Improved performance in dungeons (~20%);
Improved user interface;
New enemies and special rooms;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/24cf25b0e48abc6e4e4e9caeac52ebc948d330b9.png
Many other changes.


Improved combat system:

Enemies can be Frozen\Poisoned\Set on Fire;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39250027/7eb440b4622f845f7617dfc403f2927ffcd5c3cf.png
Enemy actions can be interrupted;
Mana was renamed to Energy. Now it's also used for Strong Attack and Blocking with a Shield;
New fight animations;
New hit and death effects for enemies;
Improved enemy behavior;


Warning! The Hub location and Progression System will be redesigned in the next update.

First of all, Happy New Year, friends! And thank you for your support over the past year!

As for the next update, we plan to add the following to it:

 The fourth level of the dungeon;
 Shields;
 New class;
 Gamepad support;
 Improve the combat system;
 New enemies, items, interactive objects, special rooms.


We are currently working hard on all of this and hope to release this update in March.
